This package holds the end-to-end tooling for the Haskell port of Hamsterdan
(https://github.com/henriquebastos/hamsterdan), pinned under
upstream/hamsterdan: tier B record and replay (docs/hamsterdan.md §5.2) and
the tier C live-run tooling. Its Python drivers run the upstream host
through its own injection points; nothing upstream is patched.

